handoff=f'''Independent utility010 regression Source review\n\nSource-only accepted: six runnable methods plus one explicit deferred F1 skip; seven planned IDs, ten planned subtests,24 hypothetical events. All tests remain UNRUN. Thirty direct physical_provenance fixture calls are planned:20 healthy/restored and10 negatives across capture_before/whole_before_result. P1/P2/P3/nested/unknown controls reach exact intended guards without earlier hash masks. L1/L2 are inert AST/token proofs. F1 supplies no cap PASS.\n\nReviewed all21 author payloads,15 original/copy pairs and41+17+24 preserved history entries. Independently retained {len(collection)} unique finite originals, three raw9/API8 observations, copies and post-read. Selected81410-byte helper and unchanged composer copies match their genuine originals. Utility007→008 three-path literal compaction/whole AST and protected lines2..6 preserved;008→010 changes only the placeholder regex in physical_provenance. All other{len(f10)-1} functions and nonfunction AST are exact.\n\nFuture loader authenticates source bytes before the single compile/exec. Synthetic records/PID17/nonces/flags live only inside private TemporaryDirectory; delegating real read/open spies reset per call and patches unwind before cleanup. Detail15/Trace13 shape does not exercise unused machine_core/Source-pool/full-lease or full actual Root attestation. No constructor004/table002 complete model fit, real bound pool20, bindings, READY/GO, current24/native/science result follows. No selected import/definitions/compiler/helper/main/test/binder ran during this review. Separately bounded genuine runtime authorization and prerequisites remain required.\n\nManifest: {MANIFEST_PIN}\nTest: {sha(test_body)}\nFull: {sha(full_body)} ({len(full_body)} bytes)\nPost: {sha(post_body)} ({len(post_body)} bytes)\nSummary: {sha(summary)} ({len(summary)} bytes)\n'''
